{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c","ja":"憧れのアイドル","zh":"憧憬的偶像","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7dc38fc040cf43991b845d2992fc1dd886c25b6e027c02f321fae588e5ccf139","ja":"「エミリーちゃんのような大和撫子になりたいです」\nと書いてるお手紙がありますよ～。","zh":"有一封信上写着\n“我想成为像艾米莉那样的大和抚子”哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5a5de87d5b49a6bebe0fdacb58230041e8330d92695c4b1a56af3db6f756ae3a","ja":"本当ですか？　えへへっ、うれしいです♪\n後でじっくり、読ませていただきますね。","zh":"真的吗？嘿嘿，好开心♪\n稍后我会认真阅读的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"34821c0bd775fabc9045748147faab381e68fa8bac266c060f5545962ff7cad9","ja":"あ、こちらのお手紙には朋花さんのことが……\nまぁ！","zh":"啊，这封信里提到了朋花……\n哎呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"20dc79db0f20543b769bf1e7caddd4c7f53a92ea64acac32ac97d5787b633861","ja":"どうしました～？　……なるほど～。\n「朋花様の子豚ちゃんになりました」ですか～。","zh":"怎么了吗～？……原来如此～。\n是“成了朋花大人的小猪仔”啊～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"88865caa300a8de28afaab9924807f5ccf7a0ef89d82cc0b519c2ad54974f2f6","ja":"どのお手紙も、\nみなさんからの愛を、とても感じますね～♪","zh":"每一封来信，\n都能深切地感受到大家满满的爱意呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6da4d87cbcfe6612242e1cbc590715f1c350fd21f76e7c2b68b82be0bc5c4fd5","ja":"はい！　あたたかい感想が\nたくさん書かれていて……！","zh":"好的！上面写了好多\n温暖的感想……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6e8572f6871cbaaffe8422365b3e052b65a4b586396d3d0176d86351b1929840","ja":"……あ。こちらは、最後に話しかけてくださった\nあの子のお手紙ではないでしょうか？","zh":"……啊。这封信该不会是\n最后跟我搭话的那个孩子写的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b194ec6964c54dc4ba861664310fbb4f63b558afdc38d02a987dbe38a6f606e3","ja":"そうですね、折り紙のお花のことも\n書いてくれています～。あと……こんなことも。","zh":"是啊，上面也写了折纸花的事呢～。\n还有……这样的内容。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a298f96051c8a52dc81db635941380a6ace5fbfc3af220bdb7762512f53f08fa","ja":"「朋花ちゃんは私の一番の憧れです！　でもライブを\n見て、エミリーちゃんも憧れの人になりました！」","zh":"“朋花是我最憧憬的人！不过看了\n演出之后，艾米莉也成了我憧憬的对象！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"48098e9e542a42c4f14ac2e0479e1fc9c848f1ef53eefd03ea2d90795e577f24","ja":"「いつかおふたりと一緒にライブができるような\nアイドルを目指して頑張ります！」だそうですよ～。","zh":"“她说‘我会以能和两位一起开演唱会的\n偶像为目标而努力！’哦～”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6e350e1fe80b837d1ca337534839278858ff32730f205044a470c1daf70d4877","ja":"ええっ！？　私のことも、ですか？","zh":"诶！？连我也算在内吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"842c4d661fa108618e995899707810f6bec1656510866410d6a6e3f6ce671b1c","ja":"はい～♪　私たちに憧れてくれた子が\nアイドルを目指して、いつかそれを実現して……。","zh":"好的～♪　憧憬着我们的女孩子\n以偶像为目标努力，并在未来的某一天实现了这个梦想……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"cc325ba0e96ec122d0346f2de52f3fc91b1b93037b6931263decdd8707c00c87","ja":"それを見て、また別の子がアイドルを目指す……。\nそんな未来があると思うと、胸が躍りますね～。","zh":"看到这一幕，又会有别的孩子以成为偶像为目标……\n一想到会有这样的未来，心里就雀跃不已呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1590.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"420ecc8266e653aba0b171f467422642a86968089dcefd422dbeaee3195f718d","ja":"はいっ！　未来の大和撫子のみなさんに\n目標にしてもらえるように、私も精進いたします！","zh":"好的！为了能成为未来的\n大和抚子们心中的榜样，我也会努力精进的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
